item.description:
@timnitgebru.blacksky.app and @emilymbender.bsky.social 
 puncture the latest AI hype, addressing everything from "hacking" to "math breakthroughs" to "superhuman" machines (and possibly break a record for scare quote usage along the way). 

https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/09/22/1144867/dont-be-fooled-summer-ai-hype/

